The Netfilter Core Team is proud to announce the addition of Eric
Leblond and Florian Westphal as a new members.

Florian and Eric are dedicated members of the Netfilter development
community with high insight and coding standards, who have been
longstanding contributors to the codebase.

By joining to the Core Team, Florian and Eric will definitely help to
give a new momentum to the development of Netfilter.

On other other hand, we have to say a big thank you to Harald Welte,
Martin Josefsson and Yasuyuki Kozakai who have now entered Emeritus.
Hundred of thousand of Netfilter installations are possible today
thanks to your past contributions.

Thank you Harald, Martin and Yasuyuki!

Welcome Florian and Eric!

Pablo,
on behalf of the Netfilter Core Team.
